# 2. MAIN PROJECT OBJECTIVE

HealthMate AI is an intelligent healthcare assistance and health-document analysis platform that demonstrates practical Large Language Model concepts through a complete full-stack application.

The application should help users:

- Upload and understand medical documents.
- Ask questions about their health reports.
- Receive grounded answers using Retrieval-Augmented Generation.
- Track health measurements over time.
- Understand health trends.
- Receive nutrition recommendations.
- Generate personalized meal plans.
- Track wellness activities and habits.
- Receive general health education.
- Interact with multiple specialized AI agents.
